# Reference imagery ships with this copy - stage 4 reads it to cross-check CMF.
# (In the upstream repo these are supplied per-checkout instead.)

# ── Committed on purpose ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are the acceptance baseline a run is measured against, not build
# artefacts. If they are ignored, the agent has nothing to compare to.
!docs/SLAB_PRD_RevC.pdf
!docs/SLAB_RevC_verification_report.md
!drawings/SLAB_GA_RevC.pdf
!renders/slab_hero.png
!renders/slab_top.png
